{"doc_id": "1611.07438", "page_idx": 0, "element_id": "1611.07438_formula_16", "latex": "\\begin{array}{l} \\Pr (e ^ {+} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {b}) = \\frac {1}{\\Pr (c ^ {+} , \\mathbf {b})} \\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (e ^ {+} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {q}) \\cdot \\Pr (c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {b}, \\mathbf {q}) \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {q} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\Pr (e ^ {+} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {q}) \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\Pr (e ^ {+} | c ^ {+}, \\mathbf {q}). \\\\ \\end{array}"}
