{"doc_id": "1611.07438", "page_idx": 0, "element_id": "1611.07438_formula_21", "latex": "\\begin{array}{l} \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}, \\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\Pr (\\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime} | \\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}, \\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}, \\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime}) \\cdot \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}} \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {X} = \\mathbf {B} \\cup \\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {x}) \\cdot \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B} ^ {\\prime}, \\mathbf {Q}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b} ^ {\\prime}, \\mathbf {q}) \\cdot \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}, \\\\ \\end{array}"}
