{"doc_id": "1611.07438", "page_idx": 0, "element_id": "1611.07438_formula_23", "latex": "\\begin{array}{l} \\hat {\\sigma} _ {\\mathbf {B}} ^ {2} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) (\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}} - \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}}) ^ {2} \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\left(\\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}}\\right) ^ {2} - 2 \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}} + \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}} ^ {2}\\right) \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) (\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}}) ^ {2} - 2 \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}} \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}} + \\hat {\\mu} _ {\\mathbf {B}} ^ {2} \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}). \\\\ \\end{array}"}
{"doc_id": "1611.07438", "page_idx": 0, "element_id": "1611.07438_formula_24", "latex": "\\begin{array}{l} \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}}\\right) ^ {2} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\left(\\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr \\left(\\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime} | \\mathbf {b}\\right) \\cdot \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2} \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\left(\\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\sqrt {\\Pr (\\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime} | \\mathbf {b})} \\cdot \\sqrt {\\Pr (\\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime} | \\mathbf {b})} \\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2}. \\\\ \\end{array}"}
