{"doc_id": "1611.07438", "page_idx": 0, "element_id": "1611.07438_formula_26", "latex": "\\begin{array}{l} \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {b}}\\right) ^ {2} \\leq \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B}, \\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {b}, \\mathbf {q} ^ {\\prime}) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2} \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {X} = \\mathbf {B} \\cup \\mathbf {Q} ^ {\\prime}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {x}) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2} = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {B} ^ {\\prime}, \\mathbf {Q}} \\Pr \\left(\\mathbf {b} ^ {\\prime}, \\mathbf {q}\\right) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2} \\\\ = \\sum_ {\\mathbf {Q}} \\Pr (\\mathbf {q}) \\cdot \\left(\\Delta P | _ {\\mathbf {q}}\\right) ^ {2}. \\\\ \\end{array}"}
